          "id": "header"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 56,
          "y": 100,
          "w": 524,
          "h": 46,
          "text": "Ninth Ring Port Commemorative Coin Appraisal Guide",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "开港纪念币鉴定指南",
            "zh": "开港纪念币鉴定指南"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F",
          "id": "title"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 166,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 110,
          "text": "Commemorative coins from the Ninth Ring Port are traded on every level of the station. This guide fixes a\nfair market value for any of them.\n\nEvery coin starts at 100¢ and is never worth less than 40¢.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "第九环港开港纪念币在各环层都有流通。本指南用于确定任何一枚纪念币的公平市场价值。\n\n所有纪念币的初始价值均为 100¢，无论状况如何，最低价值为 40¢。",
            "zh": "第九环港开港纪念币在各环层都有流通。本指南用于确定任何一枚纪念币的公平市场价值。\n\n所有纪念币的初始价值均为 100¢，无论状况如何，最低价值为 40¢。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 286,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "Three things to check",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "三项核定",
            "zh": "三项核定"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 320,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Commemorative coins generally do not circulate, so worn specimens are rare and this guide has no\ncondition grade. Read the metal, the reverse design and the serial number.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "纪念币一般不流通，基本不出现品相较差的情况，故本指南不设品相一项。\n\n核定只看三处：币面材质、背面版别图案、防伪编号。",
            "zh": "纪念币一般不流通，基本不出现品相较差的情况，故本指南不设品相一项。\n\n核定只看三处：币面材质、背面版别图案、防伪编号。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 214,
          "y": 396,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 96,
          "sprite": "ill_coin_copper_normal",
          "fit": "fit"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 114,
          "y": 500,
          "w": 400,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Copper, ordinary issue.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "铜质 · 普通版",
            "zh": "铜质 · 普通版"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "align": "center",
          "wrap": false,
          "color": "#292234"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "x": 100,
          "y": 585,
          "x2": 528,
          "y2": 585,
          "thickness": 1.2,
          "color": "#35526F"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 599,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Any piece judged counterfeit is quoted at 40¢ without exception.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "经检查判定为赝品的，一律按 40 报价。",
            "zh": "经检查判定为赝品的，一律按 40 报价。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
    },
