        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 70,
          "y": 392,
          "w": 506,
          "h": 120,
          "text": "Copper reads warm and red; its highlight is the dullest of the three.\n\nSilver plating reads cool and white, with a bright narrow highlight.\n\nGold plating reads warm yellow, with a strong highlight that fades toward the rim.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "铜偏红棕，三种里高光最暗。\n\n镀银偏冷白，高光窄而亮。\n\n镀金偏暖黄，高光强、向边缘逐渐减弱。",
            "zh": "铜偏红棕，三种里高光最暗。\n\n镀银偏冷白，高光窄而亮。\n\n镀金偏暖黄，高光强、向边缘逐渐减弱。"
          },
