          "w": 506,
          "h": 150,
          "text": "Triple number: after dropping leading zeros, at least two digits remain and all of them are the same.\n00077 counts; 00007 does not. Such a coin adds 100¢.\n\nTest coin: the first nine numbers of any range - 10001-10009, 01001-01009, 00001-00009 - adds 600¢.",
          "translations": {
            "zh-Hans": "豹子号：去掉前导 0 后至少两位、且各位数字相同。00077 算，00007 不算。这类编号加 100¢。\n\n测试币：各号段起始的九个号——10001–10009、01001–01009、00001–00009——加 600¢。",
            "zh": "豹子号：去掉前导 0 后至少两位、且各位数字相同。00077 算，00007 不算。这类编号加 100¢。\n\n测试币：各号段起始的九个号——10001–10009、01001–01009、00001–00009——加 600¢。"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "align": "left",
          "wrap": true,
          "color": "#292234"
        }
      ]
